---
layout: base.njk
title: "QTs & Cuties: A Comedy Community"
description: "Upcoming QTs & Cuties comedy shows in Denver, CO. Open mics and showcases that center queer, trans, and women performers and audiences."
---
<section class="intro">
    <h1>QTs &amp; Cuties</h1>
    <p>QTs &amp; Cuties brings Denver comedy to the stage multiple times a month, with queer, trans, and women performers at the center and everyone respectful of the room invited in.</p>
</section>

<section class="events-section">
    <h2>Upcoming Shows</h2>

    <div class="event-filters" id="event-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter events by type">
        <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
        {%- for type in events | eventTypes %}
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="{{ type | className }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ type }}</button>
        {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    
    <div id="events-container" class="events-grid">
        {% if events.length > 0 %}
            {% for event in events %}
                {% include "event-card.njk" %}
            {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
            <div class="no-events">No upcoming events at this time. Check back soon!</div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</section>

{%- if events.length > 0 %}
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ events | eventJsonLd(site) | safe }}</script>
{%- endif %}
